    {"name_ja": "VIPツアー(富士山五合目受取・返却レンタル)", "name_en": "VIP Tour (Fuji 5th Station pickup/return rental)", "note_ja": "富士スバルライン五合目で受取・返却できるレンタルプランがあり、下山後すぐ返却できるのが特長。", "note_en": "Offers a rental plan with pickup and return directly at the Fuji Subaru Line 5th Station, convenient for returning gear right after descending.", "url": "https://tour.vipliner.biz/fuji/rental/"},
